### Catalogue requests for VS Code REST Client (owner: Jana)
### Click "Send Request" above each request.
### For the staff requests, your .env must contain LOCAL_AUTH=true

# Local (npm start)
@local = http://localhost:3001
# Deployed: paste the CatalogueApiUrl output here after the first deploy
@cloud = https://REPLACE-ME.execute-api.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com

########## Public routes (no login) ##########

### Health check -> 200
GET {{local}}/health

### C7: all offices -> 200, 3 offices
GET {{local}}/offices

### C2: car 1 -> 200
GET {{local}}/cars/1

### C2: car that does not exist -> 404
GET {{local}}/cars/9999

### C2: bad id -> 400
GET {{local}}/cars/abc

### C1: all available cars -> 200, cheapest first
GET {{local}}/cars

### C1: SUVs only -> 200
GET {{local}}/cars?category=suv

### C1: office 1, max 1500 EGP/day -> 200
GET {{local}}/cars?office=1&maxPrice=1500

### C1: unknown category -> 400
GET {{local}}/cars?category=spaceship

########## Staff routes (pretend login with x-dev-user, local only) ##########

### C6: my office's cars (staff of office 1) -> 200
GET {{local}}/offices/1/cars
x-dev-user: staff:1

### C6: another office's cars -> 404
GET {{local}}/offices/2/cars
x-dev-user: staff:1

### C3: add a car -> 201 (run twice -> 409, same plate)
POST {{local}}/cars
Content-Type: application/json
x-dev-user: staff:1

{
  "plate": "JNA 777",
  "make": "Toyota",
  "model": "Yaris",
  "category": "economy",
  "dailyPrice": 950
}

### C3: customer tries to add a car -> 403
POST {{local}}/cars
Content-Type: application/json
x-dev-user: customer

{
  "plate": "JNA 778",
  "make": "Toyota",
  "model": "Yaris",
  "category": "economy",
  "dailyPrice": 950
}

### C3: not logged in -> 401
POST {{local}}/cars
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plate": "JNA 779", "make": "Toyota", "model": "Yaris", "category": "economy", "dailyPrice": 950 }

### C4: change car 1's price and put it in maintenance -> 200
PUT {{local}}/cars/1
Content-Type: application/json
x-dev-user: staff:1

{
  "dailyPrice": 1000,
  "status": "maintenance"
}

### C4: car 4 belongs to office 2 -> 404 for staff of office 1
PUT {{local}}/cars/4
Content-Type: application/json
x-dev-user: staff:1

{ "dailyPrice": 1 }

### C5: retire car 2 -> 204 (run again -> 404, already retired)
DELETE {{local}}/cars/2
x-dev-user: staff:1

### Cloud health check -> 200 (once deploying works)
GET {{cloud}}/health
